;TYPE:Custom
; Filament-specific end gcode 
;END gcode for filament
G91 ; Use relative positioning
G1 E-1 F1000 ; Retract filament slightly to prevent oozing
G1 Z7.65 F720 ; Move print head up
G1 X10 Y178 F4200 ; park print head
G1 Z35.65 F720 ; Move print head further up
G4 ; wait
G90 ; Use absolute positioning

G1 X0 Y150 F3000 ; Move bed forward to present the print
M106 S0 ; Turn off cooling fan
;M104 S0 ; Turn off extruder heater
M140 S0 ; Turn off bed heater

M221 S100 ; reset flow
M900 K0 ; reset LA
M84 ; Disable steppers
M73 P100 R0
M73 Q100 S0
